* Providing personalized gameplay experiences.
3.3. Improving Our Services
* Understanding gameplay patterns.
* Identifying technical problems.
* Improving game performance and functionality.
* Developing new features and enhancements.
3.4. Security and Abuse Prevention
* Detecting suspicious or unauthorized activities.
