However, no internet-based service or electronic storage system can guarantee absolute security.
We therefore cannot guarantee that information transmitted or stored electronically will always remain completely secure.
6. Data Retention
We retain personal information for as long as reasonably necessary to:
* Provide our Services.
* Maintain player accounts and game functionality.
* Preserve relevant gameplay history and statistics.
* Resolve disputes and investigate misuse.
* Comply with applicable legal obligations.
The retention period may vary depending on the type of information and the purpose for which it is processed.
When information is no longer required, we will take reasonable steps to delete or anonymize it, subject to applicable legal obligations and legitimate operational requirements.
Information retained in backups or security logs may remain for a limited additional period before being deleted through our normal retention processes.
